'''Ludleth''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. They can appear after the player has reached {{Skill|Garden|15}} and served {{Green|100}} unique [[The Garden#Visitor|Visitors]]. Completing their offer allows '''Ludleth''' to move to a cave surrounded by rose bushes in [[Hub Island|The Hub]] and sell the {{Item|Rose Dragon Pet}} for {{Coins|500m}}, {{Copper|20k}}, {{Item|Condensed Helianthus|amount=5}}, {{Item|All-in Aloe|amount=1}}, {{Item|Glasscorn|amount=1}}, {{Item|Devourer|amount=1}}, {{Item|Phantomleaf|amount=1}}, and {{Item|Timestalk|amount=1}}.

